(text "Power input: USB-C PD sink, input OR-ing" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 14 0) (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "25c791f2-e778-5f7c-9c8a-37ba7202d5dc"))
(text "USB-C PD sink: STUSB4500 autonomous controller. NVM must be programmed at factory test (PDO2 15V/3A, PDO3 20V/2.25A,\nPOWER_ONLY_ABOVE_5V=1), see firmware/stusb4500. Q1 passes VBUS only after an explicit contract above 5V.\nOR-ing: two LM74700 ideal-diode controllers. The higher of VBUS_SW (15-20V) and V12_POE (12V) feeds VIN, so USB-C\ntakes priority automatically and neither source can back-feed the other. System UVLO is 8V (EN divider on U5)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1dfdfd67-84ab-5cca-8495-1f1328566843"))
